# ============================================
# GitHub Linguist 语言统计配置
# 让仓库主语言显示为 C++，不影响任何下载内容
# ============================================

# ===== HTML Demo 资源：不计入语言统计 =====
Content/webnative/html/* linguist-detectable=false
*.html linguist-detectable=false
*.htm linguist-detectable=false

# ===== Web 前端脚本/样式：标记为第三方 =====
*.js linguist-vendored
*.css linguist-vendored
*.map linguist-vendored
*.svg linguist-vendored

# ===== 文档/数据 =====
*.json linguist-vendored
*.md linguist-vendored

# ===== 图片/音频/视频资源 =====
*.png linguist-vendored
*.jpg linguist-vendored
*.jpeg linguist-vendored
*.gif linguist-vendored
*.ico linguist-vendored
*.wav linguist-vendored
*.ogg linguist-vendored
*.mp3 linguist-vendored
*.mp4 linguist-vendored
*.webm linguist-vendored
*.earth-night.jpg linguist-vendored

# ===== Unreal 资产与打包产物：按二进制 =====
*.uasset binary
*.umap binary
*.pak binary
*.uexp binary
*.ubulk binary
*.uptnl binary

# ===== CEF / 原生二进制：按二进制 =====
*.lib binary
*.a binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.bin binary

# ===== 调试符号 =====
*.dSYM linguist-vendored
*.pdb linguist-vendored

# ============================================
# Git LFS：大体积二进制必须走 LFS
# 否则超过 GitHub 100MB 单文件硬限制，push 会被拒绝
#
# 注意：本节规则曾被 0ecd6d3（Linguist 配置）整文件覆盖而丢失，
# 导致新增二进制会以普通 blob 提交。修改本文件时务必保留本节。
# 8 个分支共享同一份 CEF 二进制（内容寻址，只存一份）。
# ============================================
*.so filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.dll filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pak filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.lib filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
v8_context_snapshot_generator filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text